  "description_en": "Media.io is a product in the Photo editing category. Its directory profile covers Revision Control, Text Tool, Transform tools, Remove objects, Import from web, Effects and Filters, Batch Editing, Auto Select.\n\nAdditional listed capabilities include Social Media Integration, Import-Export Option, Built-in Templates, Cloud Storage. These areas should be evaluated against the tasks, permissions and data involved in the intended workflow.\n\nDeployment is listed as Browser Based (Cloud) Desktop App (Windows). The listed organization sizes are Medium Business Small Business Individuals. API support is listed as Available. Support channels are listed as Online.\n\nThe directory's pricing snapshot states: Free Trial Available Starts at $4.99.. This is a dated third-party reference; current amounts, billing periods, trial conditions and regional availability require an official pricing check.",
  "description_zh": "Media.io 属于图片编辑软件。第三方资料列出的功能包括修订版本控制、文字工具、变换工具、物体移除、从网页导入、特效与滤镜、批量编辑、自动选择。\n\n资料还列出社交媒体集成、导入与导出、内置模板、云存储。选择时应结合实际任务、使用权限和数据处理需求逐项评估。\n\n资料所列运行方式为浏览器访问（云服务） 桌面应用 (Windows)。资料所列适用组织规模为中型企业 小型企业 个人用户。API 支持情况为提供。资料所列支持方式为在线支持。\n\n第三方定价快照显示：提供免费试用 起价为 $4.99.。这属于采集时的第三方参考，实际金额、计费周期、试用条件及地区可用性仍需核对官网。",
